# The repo is a mix: index.html is LF, script.js and custom.css are CRLF. That
# mix is exactly what silently broke fifteen harness checks -- the assertions
# embed \n in their regexes, so a CRLF file never matches. rd_source.js folds
# CRLF away when it reads, but keeping one line ending everywhere is the real
# fix, so text files are LF in the repo AND in the working copy on every
# machine. logo.png / the two jpgs are detected as binary and left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
